edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>今年登場したKAPOK Sleep Ketのグレーが、ボーダーになって登場！モノトーンのお部屋へのマッチングはもちろん、<span style="background-color: rgb(var(--background)); color: rgb(var(--text-color)); letter-spacing: var(--text-letter-spacing);">シンプルで洗練された空間を作りたい方におすすめのカラーです。</span></p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1715838064966" data-id="1715838064966"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1721370613098" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1721370613098" style="" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/kapok-sleep-ket-border" target=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/a3146118-5d3c-492c-b9af-256f44c7bd6b/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/IMG_4349.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="2000" height="2667" natural-width="2000" natural-height="2667"></a></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1721370613075" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1721370613075" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">ボーダーネイビー　<font color="#ef5151">新登場！</font></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1721370613112" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1721370613112" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>お部屋を大きく占めるベッド、更にその存在感を出してくれる、ボーダーネイビーのKAPOK Sleep Ket。ホワイトが基調のお部屋にぴったり。年代問わず人気のカラーで、プレゼントにもおすすめです</p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1715838064980" data-id="1715838064980"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1721370613073" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1721370613073" style="" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/kapok-sleep-ket-border" target=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/608e5ed3-05c7-44ba-b2fe-e5e1f8d289ae/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/IMG_4351.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="2000" height="2667" natural-width="2000" natural-height="2667"></a></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1721370613104" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1721370613104" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">ボーダーブルー　<font color="#e84949">新登場！</font></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1721370613092" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1721370613092" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>爽やかなイメージを連想させるブルーのボーダー。深みもありながら明るいブルーを採用し、ウッド調のインテリアにも馴染みやすいカラーリングです、</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1716445825909" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1716445825909" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 cl